        "filing_date": "2026-04-03",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As our offerings continue to become increasingly integrated with more Karman content, we believe that we only further enhance our competitive advantage in a supply chain characterized by fragmentation.",
        "start_character": 29031,
        "end_character": 29232
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0002040127-26-000014",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0002040127-26-000014-9fa6c0b5d6780598",
        "accession_number": "0002040127-26-000014",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-03",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "By deploying our vertically integrated, concept-to-production capabilities and our highly focused acquisition strategy, we have developed a business model designed to create long-term, sustainable value for our customers, the programs we support, the warfighter and our stockholders.",
        "start_character": 2535,
        "end_character": 2818
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0002040127-26-000014",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0002040127-26-000014-9fa6c0b5d6780598",
        "accession_number": "0002040127-26-000014",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-03",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In alignment with our customers’ needs, we intend to develop increasingly integrated system solutions through the development or acquisition of new, complementary capabilities to bolster the breadth and depth of our current integrated offerings.",
        "start_character": 28584,
        "end_character": 28829
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0002040127-26-000014",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0002040127-26-000014-9fa6c0b5d6780598",
        "accession_number": "0002040127-26-000014",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-03",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Our business model is focused on providing innovative and reliable integrated system solutions, based on our concept-to-production capabilities, which include comprehensive in-house design, analysis, testing and qualification, and production services.",
        "start_character": 5327,
        "end_character": 5578
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0002040127-26-000014",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0002040127-26-000014-9fa6c0b5d6780598",
        "accession_number": "0002040127-26-000014",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-03",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Phases of product lifecycle: We support programs in early development, testing, low rate and full rate production, increasing the probability that production revenue will increase over time as more development programs mature.",
        "start_character": 19772,
        "end_character": 19998
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0002040127-26-000014",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0002040127-26-000014-9fa6c0b5d6780598",
        "accession_number": "0002040127-26-000014",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-03",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "See “Risk Factors—Risks Related to Our Operations—If critical components or raw materials used to manufacture our products or used in our development programs become scarce or unavailable, then we may incur delays in the manufacturing and delivery of our products and in completing our development programs, which could damage our business.”",
        "start_character": 34878,
        "end_character": 35219
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0002040127-26-000014",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0002040127-26-000014-9fa6c0b5d6780598",
        "accession_number": "0002040127-26-000014",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-03",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Since we sell defense products, we can be subject to various laws and regulations governing pricing and other factors.",
        "start_character": 31420,
        "end_character": 31538
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0002040127-26-000014",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0002040127-26-000014-9fa6c0b5d6780598",
        "accession_number": "0002040127-26-000014",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-03",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also intend to selectively expand the application of our current offerings and capabilities to develop additional integrated vehicles and vessels such as lunar landers and other unmanned platforms.",
        "start_character": 28830,
        "end_character": 29030
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0002040127-26-000014",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0002040127-26-000014-9fa6c0b5d6780598",
        "accession_number": "0002040127-26-000014",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-03",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We believe our leadership team possesses the industry, leadership, operational, business development, and finance experience necessary to successfully navigate industry dynamics and drive continued, profitable growth.",
        "start_character": 23523,
        "end_character": 23740
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0002040127-26-000014",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0002040127-26-000014-9fa6c0b5d6780598",
        "accession_number": "0002040127-26-000014",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-03",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We believe that our set of integrated capabilities provides a valuable service to the marketplace, by consolidating steps in the manufacturing lifecycle in an integrated manner to meet complex customer needs.",
        "start_character": 14195,
        "end_character": 14403
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0002040127-26-000014",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0002040127-26-000014-9fa6c0b5d6780598",
        "accession_number": "0002040127-26-000014",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-03",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We must also satisfy the requirements of our customers, including OEMs, and provide these customers with products and services that comply with government regulations.",
        "start_character": 31252,
        "end_character": 31419
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0002040127-26-000014",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0002040127-26-000014-9fa6c0b5d6780598",
        "accession_number": "0002040127-26-000014",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-03",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We strive to differentiate ourselves from our competitors by manufacturing products in an accurate, reliable and repeatable manner without sacrificing attention to detail, which is evident in the durability and precision of our products.",
